차단 필요" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#195FBD;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="74" y="1579" width="513.26" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e44" value="읽을 결론: 직접 호출/공유 자료로 복사와 IPC를 줄임" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#195FBD;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="74" y="2070" width="589.68" height="35.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e45" value="대가: 처리 코드 결함이 넓은 process 권한에 도달" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="74" y="2115" width="539.3" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e46" value="B  권한 없는 처리와 Broker" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1312" y="285" width="441.2" height="46.5" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e47" value="위에서 아래로 읽기. 가로 화살표의 시작/끝이 실제 송신자/수신자." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1312" y="345" width="664.4" height="33.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e49" value="Request Controller" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1312.4" y="415" width="231.2" height="34" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e52" value="Request&lt;br&gt;Interpreter" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1593.8" y="415" width="144.4" height="62" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e55" value="Context Manager" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1807.0" y="415" width="194.0" height="34" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e58" value="Data Access Broker" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2026.4" y="415" width="231.2" height="34" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e61" value="Policy Manager" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2289.2" y="415" width="181.6" height="34" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e63" value="1  같은 목적/자료 범위 확인" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1322" y="580" width="309.14" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e65" value="현재 허용 범위 반환; Broker handle 준비" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1322" y="688" width="465.38" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e67" value="2  제한 process에 입력 + 범위 handle" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1322" y="796" width="441.44" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e69" value="3  필요한 자료 요청; ambient 권한 없음" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1322" y="904" width="447.32" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e71" value="IPC: handle + 실제 읽을 범위" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1322" y="1012" width="342.32" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e73" value="현재 허용/철회 확인" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1322" y="1120" width="215.06" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e75" value="허용된 내용만 반환" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1322" y="1228" width="202.04" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e77" value="4  추론도 Broker → Model Access → 같은 Omni" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1322" y="1336" width="542.66" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e79" value="모델 결과와 사용한 자료 근거 반환" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1322" y="1444" width="367.1" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e81" value="5  의미 제안; 신뢰 Core가 현재 검사" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1322" y="1552" width="408.26" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e83" value="위협: 직접 파일/네트워크/DB 접근은 OS 경계에서 차단" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1322" y="1660" width="576.26" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e85" value="철회: handle 무효화, 미완료 호출/늦은 결과 차단" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1322" y="1768" width="539.3" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e87" value="Broker 자체 침해는 잔여 위험; 만능 보안은 아님" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1322" y="1876" width="526.28" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e89" value="읽을 결론: 처리 코드가 잘못돼도 직접 자료 접근 차단" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1322" y="2070" width="592.76" height="35.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e90" value="대가: IPC/복사/handle 수명; Broker는 여전히 신뢰" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1322" y="2115" width="572.48" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e91" value="생략한 공통 연동: 추론은 Model Access의 한 벌 Omni; 업무 실행은 Task Manager/Agent Gateway가 Downstream Agent에 위임." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2200" width="1285.94" height="31.650000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e92" value="실선 = 요청/전달, 점선 = 결과. 별도 언급 없는 참여자는 논리 책임. 시간 간격은 성능 수치가 아닌 사건 순서. 수작업 설계 추적, 미측정." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2240" width="1323.18" height="31.650000000000002" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
